### Ordering API - End-to-End Test Suite
### Base URL
@baseUrl = https://mandiapp-ordering-api.onrender.com/api
@localUrl = http://localhost:5003/api

### Use Render for testing
@url = {{baseUrl}}

### ============================================
### 1. Health Check - Test if API is running
### ============================================
GET {{url}}/../health
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### 2. GET All Orders (for test-buyer-001)
### ============================================
GET {{url}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 200 OK with array of orders (may be empty initially)

### ============================================
### 3. Create Order - Escrow Payment
### ============================================
POST {{url}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "Fresh Tomatoes",
      "vendorId": "vendor-001",
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 40.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "productName": "Onions",
      "vendorId": "vendor-002",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 30.00
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": "123 Test Street, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400001",
  "produceTotal": 550.00,
  "logisticsFee": 50.00,
  "serviceFee": 10.00,
  "totalLandingCost": 610.00,
  "paymentMethod": "Escrow",
  "isEscrow": true
}

### Expected: 201 Created with order details

### ============================================
### 4. Complete Payment - Demo Mode with productId 0
### ============================================
POST {{url}}/orders/complete-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 0,
      "productName": "Fresh Tomatoes",
      "vendorId": "vendor-002",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 42
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": "Test Address",
  "produceTotal": 42,
  "logisticsFee": 50,
  "serviceFee": 1,
  "totalLandingCost": 93,
  "paymentMethod": "UPI",
  "isEscrow": false,
  "paymentId": "mock_pay_test123",
  "razorpayOrderId": "order_test123",
  "razorpaySignature": "mock_sig_test123",
  "paymentStatus": "Success"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with order and payment confirmation

### ============================================
### 5. Complete Payment - Real Razorpay Flow
### ============================================
POST {{url}}/orders/complete-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "Fresh Cabbage",
      "vendorId": "vendor-001",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPrice": 25
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": "456 Real Address, Delhi",
  "produceTotal": 75,
  "logisticsFee": 40,
  "serviceFee": 2,
  "totalLandingCost": 117,
  "paymentMethod": "Razorpay",
  "isEscrow": false,
  "paymentId": "pay_real123456",
  "razorpayOrderId": "order_real123456",
  "razorpaySignature": "real_signature_hash",
  "paymentStatus": "Success"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with order created and payment recorded

### ============================================
### 6. Get Specific Order by ID
### ============================================
GET {{url}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 200 OK with order details or 404 if not exists

### ============================================
### 7. Get My Orders (requires authentication)
### ============================================
GET {{url}}/orders/my-orders
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized (no auth token) or 200 OK if authenticated

### ============================================
### 8. Update Order Status
### ============================================
PUT {{url}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "Processing"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with updated order

### ============================================
### 9. Cancel Order
### ============================================
POST {{url}}/orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer request"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with cancellation confirmation

### ============================================
### 10. Get Vendor Orders (requires Vendor role)
### ============================================
GET {{url}}/orders/vendor-orders
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized (no auth token with Vendor role)

### ============================================
### TEST SCENARIOS COVERED:
### ============================================
### ✅ API Health Check
### ✅ Get all orders (test buyer)
### ✅ Create order with escrow
### ✅ Complete payment with demo mode (productId = 0)
### ✅ Complete payment with real Razorpay
### ✅ Get specific order by ID
### ✅ Get authenticated user orders
### ✅ Update order status
### ✅ Cancel order
### ✅ Vendor orders (authorization test)

### ============================================
### EXPECTED RESULTS:
### ============================================
### - All GET /orders should return 200 OK
### - POST /orders should create order and return 201
### - POST /complete-payment should handle productId=0 (demo mode)
### - POST /complete-payment should work with real product IDs
### - Foreign key constraints should be satisfied (buyers, vendors exist)
### - Orders should be retrievable after creation
### - Status updates should work
### - Cancellation should work
